<view class="page"><view class="profile-head"><view class="icon-box avatar">{{avatar}}</view><view><view class="eyebrow">STUDYAGENT 账户</view><text style="font-size:44rpx;font-weight:600">{{nickname}}</text><text class="muted" style="display:block;margin-top:6rpx">你的学习空间</text></view></view><view class="stats"><view class="stat"><text class="stat-value">{{dashboard.today_minutes || 0}}</text><text>今日分钟</text></view><view class="stat"><text class="stat-value">{{dashboard.weekly_accuracy || 0}}%</text><text>本周正确率</text></view><view class="stat"><text class="stat-value">{{dashboard.task_done || 0}}</text><text>今日完成</text></view></view><view class="detail settings"><view class="card setting-row" data-panel="ai" bindtap="openPanel"><text>AI 生成说明</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view><view class="card setting-row" data-panel="privacy" bindtap="openPanel"><text>数据与隐私</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view><view class="card setting-row" data-panel="about" bindtap="openPanel"><text>关于 StudyAgent</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view><button class="card setting-row logout" bindtap="logout"><text>退出登录</text><text class="arrow">›</text></button></view><view wx:if="{{panel}}" class="modal-mask"><view class="modal"><text style="font-size:36rpx;font-weight:600">{{panel == 'privacy' ? '数据与隐私' : panel == 'ai' ? 'AI 生成说明' : '关于 StudyAgent'}}</text><text wx:if="{{panel == 'privacy'}}" class="body-copy">我们只处理完成学习功能所需的数据。资料用于解析、向量检索和回答生成；你可以删除资料、会话和账号数据。文件存储与向量索引会随删除请求进入清理流程。</text><text wx:if="{{panel == 'privacy'}}" class="body-copy">隐私保护指引、用户协议和数据删除说明将在发布前在微信公众平台同步。</text><text wx:if="{{panel == 'ai'}}" class="body-copy">聊天、学习计划、测验和解析可能由 AI 生成。AI 生成 · 请核验重要信息，不应替代专业意见。</text><text wx:if="{{panel == 'about'}}" class="body-copy">StudyAgent 将个人学习资料整理为可追溯的知识库，回答只引用当前知识库中的真实片段。</text><button wx:if="{{panel == 'privacy'}}" class="button ghost" style="width:100%;margin-top:20rpx" bindtap="deleteAccount">删除账号数据</button><button class="button primary" style="width:100%;margin-top:20rpx" bindtap="closePanel">关闭</button></view></view></view>
